w it. Nothing breaks."]},{"id":"commissions","kind":"index","title":"commissions are open","body":["Bust, half body, full body. Original characters welcome, fan characters welcome, your D&D guy especially welcome.","DM me on Instagram with what you want, references if you have them, and roughly when you need it.","I will tell you a price and a turnaround before either of us commits to anything."],"links":[{"label":"@tiredmedi on Instagram","href":"https://www.instagram.com/tiredmedi/"},{"label":"buy me a coffee","href":"https://buymeacoffee.com/hananseifu1"}]},{"id":"process","kind":"sticky","title":"how this works","body":["Everything here is taped to a wall. Drag a piece and it peels; throw it and it slides off somewhere and stays there.","Pieces with a play marker were drawn on video — they loop where they hang, and the full timelapse is on the back. Turn any piece over by double-clicking it.","Rewrite me. This is a draft written by someone who is not Medi."]},{"id":"about","kind":"note","title":"who is doing this","body":["Medi. She/her. I have been drawing for a while and posting for less time than that.","The old version of this site was mostly jokes about One Piece and being bad at talking to people. (it wasnt me, it was the fault of someone shorter than me😭) That was accurate. This version has more drawings on it.","(ps. from said short person: it was accurate!)"],"links":[{"label":"short person","href":"https://kmab5.github.io"}]},{"id":"currently","kind":"receipt","title":"currently","body":["Working on: something with too many hands in it.","Avoiding: backgrounds.","Last updated: whenever I last edited notes.json, which is displayed below."]}]}